WEBVTT

01:21.330 --> 01:26.780
[A Splendid Match]

01:27.600 --> 01:29.740
[Episode 33]

01:30.510 --> 01:31.200
How could I possibly have

01:31.200 --> 01:32.660
a useless nephew like you?

01:33.200 --> 01:33.920
If you didn't have the ability,

01:33.920 --> 01:35.450
why did you take on this job?

01:36.310 --> 01:37.759
It's lucky we found out early.

01:37.759 --> 01:39.590
If these goods had reached
the Nine Border Garrisons

01:39.590 --> 01:41.200
and the soldiers ended up freezing,
that would've been bad enough—

01:41.200 --> 01:42.950
but if it shook the army's morale,
that'd be the real problem.

01:42.950 --> 01:44.400
And if the matter escalated,

01:44.400 --> 01:45.789
and the Imperial Court
traced it back to the Dai family—

01:45.789 --> 01:46.870
passing off inferior goods as proper ones,

01:46.870 --> 01:47.729
embezzlement,

01:47.920 --> 01:49.710
pocketing court funds—

01:49.950 --> 01:51.430
that'd be the crime
of deceiving the Emperor.

01:51.430 --> 01:52.960
Do you all have a death wish?

01:54.039 --> 01:54.759
Aunt.

01:54.759 --> 01:55.150
I...

01:55.430 --> 01:57.470
I know I was wrong.

01:57.840 --> 01:58.509
From now on,

01:58.509 --> 02:00.170
I swear I'll never do it again.

02:00.790 --> 02:01.950
Aunt,

02:02.640 --> 02:04.240
the most important thing now

02:04.400 --> 02:06.400
is finding a way to cover it up.

02:06.950 --> 02:07.590
Aunt,

02:08.000 --> 02:09.680
the Imperial Court's deadline

02:09.680 --> 02:11.030
is only three days away.

02:11.360 --> 02:12.820
Scraping together 50,000

02:12.960 --> 02:14.280
winter coats,

02:14.280 --> 02:14.750
I...

02:15.400 --> 02:17.400
I truly can't come up with that many.

02:18.400 --> 02:19.520
My good Aunt,

02:19.520 --> 02:20.710
please help me!

02:20.710 --> 02:21.150
Madam.

02:21.150 --> 02:22.360
My good Aunt.

02:22.470 --> 02:24.150
Madam Chen requests an audience.

02:24.150 --> 02:25.030
Madam Chen?

02:34.190 --> 02:36.190
I heard you've been troubled lately

02:36.280 --> 02:36.710
over the winter coats

02:36.710 --> 02:39.040
for the Nine Border Garrisons' soldiers.

02:41.120 --> 02:42.280
Please don't get me wrong.

02:42.280 --> 02:43.430
I didn't mean to pry.

02:44.240 --> 02:46.240
It's just that my grandmother's family

02:46.240 --> 02:47.120
once also bid

02:47.360 --> 02:49.220
for this Ministry of War's order.

02:52.150 --> 02:53.590
I heard that this batch of winter coats

02:53.590 --> 02:55.120
is still short in quantity.

02:55.310 --> 02:56.710
If you don't mind,

02:57.240 --> 02:58.100
I happen to have

02:58.240 --> 02:59.360
some stock on hand.

03:00.310 --> 03:01.440
How many do you have?

03:02.280 --> 03:02.800
Qingpu.

03:11.180 --> 03:11.530
[Ji's Capital Region Winter Coats Ledger]

03:11.570 --> 03:15.500
[Tongzhou Canal, North Bank Warehouse,
Fine Cotton Padded Jackets, 10,000 pieces]

03:12.590 --> 03:14.470
Across all the warehouses combined,

03:14.470 --> 03:15.770
we currently have 35,000 in total.

03:15.770 --> 03:16.579
[Capital City, Chaoyang Gate South
Warehouse, Silk-lined Cotton Robes, 5,000]

03:16.800 --> 03:18.120
If that's still not enough,

03:18.120 --> 03:20.180
we can push our suppliers these days,

03:20.360 --> 03:22.030
and we may be able to get more.

03:27.460 --> 03:29.150
That's very thoughtful of you.

03:29.150 --> 03:30.880
Then I won't stand on ceremony.

03:31.870 --> 03:33.120
Let's just say the Dai family

03:33.120 --> 03:34.870
is buying these coats from you.

03:35.430 --> 03:36.360
Name your price,

03:36.520 --> 03:37.780
and we will pay in full.

03:38.560 --> 03:39.550
It's your call.

03:41.430 --> 03:42.150
You have truly

03:42.150 --> 03:43.880
saved me from a dire situation;

03:43.960 --> 03:45.960
I really need to thank you properly.

03:46.520 --> 03:47.120
Madam.

03:47.400 --> 03:49.190
Please don't treat me like an outsider.

03:49.190 --> 03:51.630
Jiuheng sees
the Senior Grand Secretary as his father,

03:51.630 --> 03:52.829
and you as his mother.

03:53.079 --> 03:54.610
I feel exactly the same way.

03:54.870 --> 03:55.630
This is

03:55.710 --> 03:56.770
the least we can do.

04:01.520 --> 04:03.000
I heard that recently,

04:03.000 --> 04:04.240
you and Mrs. Wang

04:04.560 --> 04:06.090
had a bit of a disagreement.

04:07.840 --> 04:09.000
She is just

04:09.000 --> 04:10.150
hot-tempered.

04:10.560 --> 04:12.290
Please don't take it personal.

04:13.000 --> 04:13.430
Yes.

04:15.800 --> 04:16.720
How about this?

04:17.390 --> 04:18.950
Next month's tea gathering,

04:18.950 --> 04:20.149
I'll have you host it.

04:20.390 --> 04:21.390
What do you think?

04:24.920 --> 04:25.920
Thank you, Madam.

04:33.240 --> 04:35.510
You couldn't even handle
such a simple task.

04:35.510 --> 04:36.310
Third Master,

04:36.600 --> 04:39.070
I didn't expect the timing
to be so unfortunate.

04:39.070 --> 04:40.040
Just as I was about to talk

04:40.040 --> 04:40.640
to Qingpu,

04:41.040 --> 04:42.240
Second Master Yao from the Ji family

04:42.240 --> 04:43.159
suddenly showed up,

04:43.159 --> 04:43.750
and he came specifically

04:43.750 --> 04:44.950
for the winter clothes.

04:44.950 --> 04:46.040
I...

04:46.390 --> 04:46.920
Alright.

04:47.070 --> 04:48.670
Go receive your punishment.

04:49.560 --> 04:50.000
Yes.

04:58.000 --> 04:58.870
Third Master,

05:00.160 --> 05:01.000
you clearly

05:01.000 --> 05:02.800
did all of this for Madam's sake.

05:03.000 --> 05:04.460
Why not just tell her?

05:04.600 --> 05:06.160
Do you remember what I told you before?

05:06.160 --> 05:06.870
She once

05:07.310 --> 05:09.040
wanted to do business in Shanxi

05:09.190 --> 05:10.920
as a backup plan for her future.

05:11.000 --> 05:11.950
After marrying me,

05:11.950 --> 05:13.390
she stayed in the capital,

05:13.390 --> 05:14.800
yet she still takes the business of

05:14.800 --> 05:16.800
Linxia Restaurant very seriously.

05:16.950 --> 05:18.510
If I interfere too much,

05:19.120 --> 05:21.180
it will only make her uncomfortable.

05:22.040 --> 05:23.240
I see.

05:25.870 --> 05:26.750
We didn't

05:26.750 --> 05:27.920
help Madam directly this time,

05:27.920 --> 05:28.600
but

05:28.830 --> 05:30.430
bringing down Zheng Xiaoyou

05:30.630 --> 05:31.600
still settles

05:31.830 --> 05:33.560
the score for her.

05:35.920 --> 05:36.920
That's true.

05:38.000 --> 05:38.730
I don't care!

05:39.310 --> 05:40.840
Gu Jinzhao has gone too far.

05:41.000 --> 05:42.659
You have to get revenge for me!

05:42.750 --> 05:44.950
How am I supposed to do that?

05:46.310 --> 05:47.800
You were running a usury business outside,

05:47.800 --> 05:48.750
which was a serious matter,

05:48.750 --> 05:49.950
yet you never told me.

05:50.040 --> 05:50.950
Now that you've suffered losses,

05:50.950 --> 05:51.950
and you come crying to me?

05:51.950 --> 05:52.720
You even bypassed me

05:52.720 --> 05:54.680
and dealt with Zheng Xiaoyou directly.

05:54.680 --> 05:56.600
He's the Governor of Shuntian Prefecture,

05:56.600 --> 05:58.040
not your doorman.

05:58.040 --> 05:58.830
How many times have you

05:58.830 --> 06:00.310
covered for Zheng Xiaoyou?

06:00.310 --> 06:02.770
What's wrong with me
giving him a few orders?

06:06.120 --> 06:08.520
Madam, here's a message from Chen Mansion.

06:08.680 --> 06:10.120
The Chen Mansion again?

06:11.260 --> 06:13.510
[Linxia Restaurant Invitation]

06:14.560 --> 06:15.620
A tea gathering...

06:16.430 --> 06:17.630
It's a tea gathering.

06:18.290 --> 06:20.830
[Inviting Madam to Linxia Restaurant
on the 6th day of Midsummer]

06:22.080 --> 06:22.910
What is it?

06:23.070 --> 06:24.200
Linxia Restaurant.

06:24.750 --> 06:25.240
Madam Fu actually

06:25.240 --> 06:27.370
let Gu Jinzhao host the tea gathering!

06:28.920 --> 06:29.950
This Gu family's daughter

06:29.950 --> 06:31.150
is really something.

06:31.630 --> 06:32.680
It seems she has won

06:32.680 --> 06:34.940
the favor of the Grand Secretary's wife.

06:38.000 --> 06:38.430
Don't.

06:38.450 --> 06:39.190
No, no, no.

06:39.750 --> 06:40.800
-So infuriating!
-Those are expensive!

06:40.800 --> 06:41.270
This...

06:41.270 --> 06:42.000
These are...

06:42.000 --> 06:42.310
Not that one!

06:42.310 --> 06:42.870
-I'm so mad!
-You can't throw that one!

06:42.870 --> 06:43.560
Don't throw this!

06:43.560 --> 06:45.130
That one is very expensive!

06:45.510 --> 06:46.310
Don't.

06:46.310 --> 06:47.159
Don't be mad.

06:47.159 --> 06:48.310
Calm down.

06:48.340 --> 06:49.070
Calm down.

06:50.830 --> 06:52.240
It's not a big deal.

06:52.600 --> 06:54.159
I'll find a way to get back at her.

06:54.159 --> 06:55.409
Just listen to me.

06:56.110 --> 06:57.720
I've already asked Zheng Xiaoyou

06:57.720 --> 06:59.950
to gather evidence
of Third Mr. Chen's crimes.

06:59.950 --> 07:00.900
Really?

07:01.600 --> 07:02.590
Once we have solid evidence,

07:02.590 --> 07:04.390
I'll have him formally impeached.

07:04.390 --> 07:05.520
How does that sound?

07:05.600 --> 07:07.260
Master. Master.

07:07.390 --> 07:09.040
Something terrible has happened!

07:09.040 --> 07:10.560
What is it now?

07:10.680 --> 07:11.680
A message has just arrived.

07:11.680 --> 07:12.680
Lord Zheng Xiaoyou was in the middle of

07:12.680 --> 07:14.680
holding court at Shuntian Prefecture

07:14.680 --> 07:16.240
when the Court of Judicial Review burst in

07:16.240 --> 07:17.920
and dragged him away on the spot.

07:17.920 --> 07:19.920
They say he's facing multiple charges:

07:19.920 --> 07:21.600
taking bribes, selling official posts,

07:21.600 --> 07:24.600
and allowing his servants
to commit acts of violence.

07:26.360 --> 07:27.160
Third Mr. Chen

07:27.950 --> 07:28.800
Third Mr. Chen

07:29.510 --> 07:30.870
It must be Third Mr. Chen.

07:30.870 --> 07:31.730
Third Mr. Chen.

07:33.430 --> 07:34.290
Third Mr. Chen.

07:34.930 --> 07:38.290
Third Mr. Chen.

07:38.310 --> 07:39.940
Third Mr. Chen!

07:46.800 --> 07:48.390
You are so skillful, Madam.

07:48.830 --> 07:50.540
With just a few adjustments,

07:50.680 --> 07:52.600
this looks incredibly elegant.

07:53.390 --> 07:54.070
It's just a way

07:54.070 --> 07:55.480
to pass the time.

07:55.680 --> 07:57.880
It's not as amazing as you make it sound.

07:58.510 --> 07:59.510
I heard

07:59.830 --> 08:01.560
that Jiuheng's wife

08:01.870 --> 08:03.390
and Wang Xuanfan's wife

08:04.040 --> 08:05.270
have been fighting

08:05.390 --> 08:06.720
quite fiercely lately.

08:07.160 --> 08:08.090
Oh, absolutely.

08:08.360 --> 08:11.160
They even brought their drama
right in front of me.

08:11.310 --> 08:13.350
Like husband, like wife.

08:13.950 --> 08:14.920
Usually,

08:15.390 --> 08:16.470
Jiuheng

08:16.830 --> 08:18.040
and Wang Xuanfan

08:18.430 --> 08:20.560
are competing with each other as well.

08:21.510 --> 08:22.830
Wasn't that because

08:22.950 --> 08:25.190
my husband deliberately used some tricks

08:25.190 --> 08:26.920
to put them against each other?

08:28.870 --> 08:29.750
Madam,

08:30.160 --> 08:32.020
you are just as capable as Master.

08:49.510 --> 08:50.710
What brings you here?

08:52.790 --> 08:54.910
I heard Zheng Xiaoyou was arrested.

08:55.440 --> 08:56.600
Was that your doing?

08:57.910 --> 08:58.970
You could say that.

09:02.030 --> 09:02.790
Thank you.

09:03.360 --> 09:04.890
There's no need to thank me.

09:05.120 --> 09:05.920
Zheng Xiaoyou

09:06.440 --> 09:08.910
was notorious during his time
as Governor of Shuntian Prefecture.

09:08.910 --> 09:09.790
Previously, out of respect

09:09.790 --> 09:10.960
for Wang Xuanfan,

09:10.960 --> 09:11.670
I didn't touch him.

09:11.670 --> 09:12.360
But he actually

09:12.360 --> 09:13.820
had the nerve to cross you.

09:13.960 --> 09:15.160
If I let him off again,

09:16.150 --> 09:18.080
I don't deserve to be your husband.

09:19.270 --> 09:20.960
Hearing you speak just now

09:21.320 --> 09:22.960
suddenly reminded me

09:23.120 --> 09:24.270
of the first time

09:24.390 --> 09:25.850
I met you at the Ji Mansion.

09:26.440 --> 09:27.840
What was I like back then?

09:28.550 --> 09:31.270
Decisive, powerful, and commanding.

09:31.750 --> 09:32.750
Well, now

09:33.600 --> 09:34.440
you've married

09:34.440 --> 09:36.770
to that powerful and commanding husband.

09:36.870 --> 09:37.670
In the future,

09:38.670 --> 09:40.000
whenever you run into trouble,

09:40.000 --> 09:40.440
you don't have to

09:40.440 --> 09:42.570
carry everything on your own anymore.

09:43.200 --> 09:44.200
Even now,

09:44.360 --> 09:46.240
you're already carrying things for me.

09:46.240 --> 09:47.390
If it weren't for you,

09:47.390 --> 09:49.200
how could I be so calm?

09:50.030 --> 09:52.200
Madam Wang could crush

09:52.270 --> 09:53.750
a merchant like me

09:53.750 --> 09:55.350
without lifting her finger.

09:56.440 --> 09:57.320
Actually,

09:57.720 --> 09:58.440
ever since the first time

09:58.440 --> 09:59.600
I met you,

09:59.840 --> 10:01.240
I've been relying on you.

10:01.670 --> 10:02.870
Our Ji family,

10:02.960 --> 10:04.090
and the Gu family...

10:04.120 --> 10:05.510
Think about how much you've helped me,

10:05.510 --> 10:07.440
and how many times you've saved me.

10:08.270 --> 10:09.530
Honestly, I'm worried

10:09.670 --> 10:10.510
that one day,

10:10.870 --> 10:12.730
I'll get so used to relying on you.

10:17.390 --> 10:18.600
You certainly know

10:19.000 --> 10:20.460
how to sweet-talk people.

10:21.750 --> 10:22.960
If you keep this up,

10:24.030 --> 10:25.690
I might actually believe you.

10:27.020 --> 10:28.550
I am a merchant's daughter.

10:29.000 --> 10:30.510
Sweet-talking is my specialty.

10:30.510 --> 10:31.360
Is that so?

10:38.320 --> 10:38.910
My Lady.

10:43.370 --> 10:49.960
[Immersed in the Classics and History]

10:45.120 --> 10:45.670
My Lady.

10:47.910 --> 10:48.720
What is it?

10:49.000 --> 10:50.270
Young Master Xuanqing

10:50.270 --> 10:51.320
is waiting outside the door.

10:51.320 --> 10:51.960
He wants to know what time you plan

10:51.960 --> 10:54.020
to leave for the Yu Mansion tomorrow.

10:56.510 --> 10:57.640
Tell him we'll leave

10:58.030 --> 10:59.550
between 7 and 9 in the morning.

10:59.550 --> 11:00.150
Yes.

11:10.870 --> 11:12.130
Are you free tomorrow?

11:14.240 --> 11:15.040
What's wrong?

11:15.600 --> 11:16.960
How about we go together

11:17.320 --> 11:19.120
to the Yu Mansion to set the date?

11:21.750 --> 11:22.390
Okay.

11:28.150 --> 11:31.200
[Diligent by Day, Vigilant by Night]

11:32.550 --> 11:33.080
Uncle.

11:33.960 --> 11:34.440
Aunt.

11:35.240 --> 11:36.580
Please get up, nephew.

11:36.790 --> 11:37.450
Have a seat.

11:44.600 --> 11:45.660
Our Old Madam

11:45.840 --> 11:48.170
had a master pick three auspicious dates.

11:48.960 --> 11:50.360
Please take a look, Master Yu

11:50.360 --> 11:51.090
and Madam Yu.

11:52.510 --> 11:53.270
Thank you.

11:56.370 --> 11:58.250
[November 8th, March 8th, December 6th
of the lunar calendar]

11:56.960 --> 11:58.040
Not bad.

11:58.320 --> 11:59.440
These three dates,

11:59.550 --> 12:00.680
all look great to me.

12:01.390 --> 12:04.120
We'll leave the final choice
to you and Lord Chen.

12:06.030 --> 12:08.150
Then let Wanxue choose a date.

12:08.550 --> 12:09.390
Yes.

12:12.000 --> 12:13.390
I don't know what's been

12:13.390 --> 12:14.790
bothering Wanxue lately.

12:14.790 --> 12:16.320
She's so deeply distressed

12:17.270 --> 12:19.200
that she can barely sleep at night.

12:26.360 --> 12:27.080
How about

12:27.200 --> 12:28.320
I go check on her?

12:29.150 --> 12:29.960
Well...

12:30.630 --> 12:31.630
I happen to want to

12:31.630 --> 12:33.090
have a word with her alone.

12:33.200 --> 12:33.960
Alright.

12:34.030 --> 12:34.770
That's good.

12:34.870 --> 12:35.720
Please escort

12:35.960 --> 12:37.150
Madam Chen over.

12:37.360 --> 12:37.870
Yes.

12:41.320 --> 12:42.380
I'll head over now.

12:42.840 --> 12:43.370
Alright.

12:43.670 --> 12:44.240
Go ahead.

13:07.000 --> 13:08.360
Uncle, Aunt.

13:09.240 --> 13:10.840
I prepared a gift for Wanxue,

13:11.320 --> 13:12.790
but I left it in the carriage outside.

13:12.790 --> 13:14.150
I'll go get it now.

13:15.550 --> 13:16.720
Alright. Go ahead.

13:33.030 --> 13:33.720
Third Aunt.

13:40.910 --> 13:42.320
You should be in the front courtyard.

13:42.320 --> 13:43.850
What are you doing out here?

13:44.270 --> 13:45.470
There are a few things

13:45.670 --> 13:47.670
I'd like you to pass along to Wanxue.

13:49.630 --> 13:50.690
Excuse us, you two.

13:51.360 --> 13:53.020
Please step away for a moment.

14:01.150 --> 14:02.000
It really isn't easy

14:02.000 --> 14:03.600
to get a chance to talk to you.

14:04.840 --> 14:06.970
The way you've been avoiding me lately

14:07.120 --> 14:08.850
has made me suspect something.

14:09.510 --> 14:10.440
What is it?

14:11.510 --> 14:12.960
I suspect you still can't

14:13.750 --> 14:15.680
let go of what happened between us.

14:16.150 --> 14:17.060
Shut up.

14:17.270 --> 14:18.400
You misunderstood.

14:18.670 --> 14:19.600
Misunderstood?

14:20.090 --> 14:20.630
Yes.

14:21.120 --> 14:22.050
Three years ago,

14:22.240 --> 14:23.790
you asked me to meet at Yong'an Bridge.

14:23.790 --> 14:24.600
I went there.

14:25.960 --> 14:26.960
I really did.

14:27.670 --> 14:28.390
I even saw the kite

14:28.390 --> 14:29.360
you flew for me.

14:30.720 --> 14:32.510
The reason I didn't come to see you

14:32.510 --> 14:33.270
was because Third Uncle...

14:33.270 --> 14:34.670
I don't want to hear this.

14:37.270 --> 14:37.840
It was supposed to be us

14:37.840 --> 14:38.790
being together.

14:44.320 --> 14:46.380
The servants can't hear us right now.

14:47.240 --> 14:48.750
But if you keep looking back

14:48.750 --> 14:50.030
at them like that,

14:51.200 --> 14:53.260
they'll start to suspect something.

14:59.360 --> 14:59.890
I don't know

14:59.890 --> 15:01.420
why you're telling me this.

15:01.790 --> 15:03.850
If you're trying to test my attitude,

15:04.030 --> 15:05.690
then let me make myself clear:

15:05.790 --> 15:06.790
What's past

15:07.120 --> 15:08.270
is in the past.

15:08.840 --> 15:10.200
It's water under the bridge,

15:10.200 --> 15:12.000
and I forgot about that long ago.

15:12.910 --> 15:13.550
Forgot?

15:15.670 --> 15:17.000
Water under the bridge?

15:17.670 --> 15:18.550
That's right.

15:20.600 --> 15:22.330
Since you've made your choice,

15:22.840 --> 15:24.440
please keep it firmly in mind

15:24.840 --> 15:27.040
and stop causing trouble for no reason.

15:27.840 --> 15:29.570
You came to the Yu Mansion today

15:29.670 --> 15:31.270
to set the wedding date.

15:33.270 --> 15:34.870
Wanxue is a good girl

15:35.150 --> 15:37.080
and she loves you wholeheartedly.

15:38.080 --> 15:38.680
Even after

15:38.690 --> 15:40.620
the things you said to her that day,

15:40.670 --> 15:42.330
she still wants to be with you.

15:42.800 --> 15:44.860
Don't take what you have for granted.

15:45.360 --> 15:46.960
Don't break her heart again.

16:06.360 --> 16:06.910
Third...

16:10.360 --> 16:12.560
Do you have any idea what you're saying?

16:22.440 --> 16:23.940
For the sake of the Yu family,

16:23.940 --> 16:25.600
I will leave you some dignity.

16:25.630 --> 16:26.600
From today on,

16:26.960 --> 16:28.910
you'll move into the Hanlin Academy.

16:28.910 --> 16:29.720
Without my permission,

16:29.720 --> 16:31.520
you can't return to the mansion.

16:41.750 --> 16:42.550
Young Master.

16:43.630 --> 16:44.560
Are you alright?

16:53.000 --> 16:55.150
[Thrice Reflections Against Greed;
Ninefold Virtues in the Sound of the Qin]

16:54.240 --> 16:55.320
It seems they first met

16:55.250 --> 16:59.460
[Immersed in the Classics and History]

16:55.320 --> 16:56.870
at the coming-of-age ceremony.

16:56.870 --> 16:58.720
That day, Madam accidentally
fell into the water.

16:58.720 --> 16:59.750
After waking up,

16:59.870 --> 17:00.240
she mistakenly believed

17:00.240 --> 17:01.670
that Young Master Xuanqing
was the one who saved her.

17:01.670 --> 17:02.510
So she prepared generous gifts

17:02.510 --> 17:04.040
for Young Master Xuanqing.

17:04.160 --> 17:05.829
Later, Madam came to the capital.

17:05.829 --> 17:07.270
And Ji Yao, the Second Young Master Ji,

17:07.270 --> 17:08.750
was studying at Cunshan Academy,

17:08.750 --> 17:10.640
when Madam brought him to the academy,

17:10.640 --> 17:12.720
she met Young Master Xuanqing again.

17:13.240 --> 17:14.069
Once,

17:14.349 --> 17:15.720
Young Lord Ye had

17:15.880 --> 17:17.829
a confrontation with Madam at the academy.

17:17.829 --> 17:18.829
I've asked around

17:19.310 --> 17:20.960
and learned that Madam

17:21.440 --> 17:22.160
had actually gone there that day

17:22.160 --> 17:24.310
to return a book to Young Master Xuanqing.

17:24.310 --> 17:25.200
After that,

17:25.829 --> 17:27.430
they had some interactions.

17:27.510 --> 17:30.160
Until Young Master Xuanqing's
birthday that year,

17:30.160 --> 17:31.400
Madam...

17:33.000 --> 17:34.000
Go on.

17:34.750 --> 17:35.510
Yes.

17:36.720 --> 17:38.400
Madam made a kite herself.

17:38.720 --> 17:39.510
They agreed

17:39.510 --> 17:40.970
to meet at Yong'an Bridge.

17:41.110 --> 17:42.200
But for some reason,

17:42.200 --> 17:43.960
Young Master Xuanqing never showed up.

17:43.960 --> 17:44.820
And after that,

17:45.310 --> 17:46.770
things simply faded away.

17:51.400 --> 17:52.070
I have

17:52.790 --> 17:54.590
another presumptuous request.

17:56.680 --> 17:57.750
Could you

17:58.200 --> 17:58.640
hold off on

17:58.640 --> 18:00.430
arranging the marriage for me until after

18:00.430 --> 18:02.270
the metropolitan examination is over?

18:02.270 --> 18:02.920
Why?

18:04.110 --> 18:05.240
Do you have

18:05.870 --> 18:07.000
any other thoughts?

18:07.420 --> 18:08.070
No.

18:08.880 --> 18:09.510
I just

18:10.310 --> 18:11.510
don't want to rush it.

18:13.510 --> 18:14.720
I was the one who arranged

18:14.720 --> 18:16.520
his marriage with the Yu family.

18:16.590 --> 18:18.720
He was somewhat reluctant at the time.

18:19.590 --> 18:21.270
It wasn't until I told him the truth about

18:21.270 --> 18:23.530
his birth father's death that he agreed.

18:25.350 --> 18:26.160
So it seems

18:26.510 --> 18:27.590
he chose his future

18:27.590 --> 18:28.880
over Jinzhao.

18:30.350 --> 18:31.150
Third Master.

18:31.440 --> 18:32.750
Madam was young at the time,

18:32.750 --> 18:34.310
falling in love for the first time.

18:34.310 --> 18:36.070
It was only natural
for her to be a little naive.

18:36.070 --> 18:38.000
Falling in love for the first time.

18:43.030 --> 18:45.110
Falling in love for the first time...

18:56.270 --> 18:58.070
Have someone to keep an eye on him.

18:58.070 --> 18:58.830
You mean him...

18:58.830 --> 18:59.510
or her?

19:00.400 --> 19:01.440
Chen Xuanqing.

19:03.640 --> 19:04.160
Yes.

19:57.510 --> 19:58.790
Madam was young at the time,

19:58.790 --> 20:00.270
falling in love for the first time.

20:00.270 --> 20:02.310
It was only natural
for her to be a little naive.

20:02.310 --> 20:04.430
I plan to remain unmarried in the future.

20:04.430 --> 20:05.880
Sages all say that

20:06.030 --> 20:07.350
the key to marriage

20:07.390 --> 20:08.990
lies in mutual suitability.

20:10.310 --> 20:11.680
This means that marriage

20:11.680 --> 20:13.270
should be good for both parties.

20:13.270 --> 20:14.530
That's the principle.

20:17.830 --> 20:18.830
What's past

20:19.160 --> 20:20.510
is in the past.

20:20.920 --> 20:22.270
It's water under the bridge.

20:22.270 --> 20:24.070
And I forgot about that long ago.

20:24.830 --> 20:26.160
Water under the bridge?

20:26.880 --> 20:27.680
That's right.

20:28.690 --> 20:30.420
Since you've made your choice,

20:30.590 --> 20:32.250
please keep it firmly in mind,

20:32.550 --> 20:34.550
and stop causing trouble for no reason.

20:34.550 --> 20:35.880
I know perfectly well

20:36.510 --> 20:38.830
that whether it's my anger toward Jinzhao

20:38.830 --> 20:40.760
or my hatred toward Chen Xuanqing,

20:40.790 --> 20:42.050
it's all meaningless—

20:42.830 --> 20:44.900
childish, even.

20:45.640 --> 20:46.510
But I...

20:47.070 --> 20:48.510
still can't get over it.

20:51.960 --> 20:54.240
Moving back to the Hanlin Academy
might be for the best.

20:54.240 --> 20:55.720
Being away from the mansion

20:55.720 --> 20:57.350
will let you focus on your duties.

20:57.350 --> 20:58.410
After some time,

20:58.510 --> 21:00.110
you can go back
and apologize to Third Master.

21:00.110 --> 21:02.240
There's still a chance to mend things.

21:03.310 --> 21:04.160
Apologize?

21:09.200 --> 21:10.260
What did I do wrong?

21:11.310 --> 21:12.110
Young Master.

21:12.510 --> 21:13.440
All these years,

21:14.640 --> 21:16.840
I've worked myself to the bone studying

21:17.070 --> 21:19.200
just to bring honor to the Chen family.

21:19.750 --> 21:21.880
I've catered to everyone
in the Chen family.

21:21.880 --> 21:23.140
Haven't I done enough?

21:26.270 --> 21:28.550
Just because the Chen family
did me a favor,

21:28.550 --> 21:30.410
and I have to compromise forever?

21:31.000 --> 21:32.200
Because he took me in,

21:32.510 --> 21:33.510
I have to do

21:33.510 --> 21:34.400
whatever he says?

21:34.400 --> 21:35.790
I'm not allowed to disobey him at all,

21:35.790 --> 21:36.590
is that right?

21:38.510 --> 21:39.440
Even when the woman I love

21:39.440 --> 21:40.700
was taken away from me,

21:42.550 --> 21:43.160
I'm not even allowed

21:43.160 --> 21:45.220
to show the slightest bit of sadness.

21:49.270 --> 21:50.070
Young Master,

21:50.350 --> 21:51.510
keep your voice down.

21:51.510 --> 21:52.680
This is the duty room.

21:52.680 --> 21:53.940
What are you afraid of?

21:54.790 --> 21:55.680
Do you think Chen Yanyun

21:55.680 --> 21:56.740
will still help us?

22:00.490 --> 22:01.330
You're wrong.

22:02.070 --> 22:02.830
He is

22:03.350 --> 22:04.680
narrow-minded

22:04.680 --> 22:05.750
and vindictive.

22:07.680 --> 22:08.440
Now that he knows

22:08.440 --> 22:10.350
Gu Jinzhao once had feelings for me,

22:10.350 --> 22:11.070
so he wants

22:12.110 --> 22:13.920
to see me dead.

22:16.400 --> 22:18.070
That won't happen, Young Master.

22:18.070 --> 22:20.070
You are still the Tanhua, after all.

22:20.550 --> 22:22.200
There will always be opportunities.

22:22.200 --> 22:23.400
What opportunities?

22:23.880 --> 22:25.000
Others just think

22:25.440 --> 22:26.800
that I have a Grand Secretary uncle—

22:26.800 --> 22:28.550
a powerful tree to rely on.

22:28.920 --> 22:29.980
What they don't see

22:30.310 --> 22:32.170
is that he never gives me a chance;

22:32.510 --> 22:34.840
on the contrary, he's on guard against me.

22:35.200 --> 22:36.600
He refuses to support me,

22:37.030 --> 22:38.910
yet still occupies the moral high ground,

22:38.910 --> 22:40.110
making it impossible for me
to seek another patron

22:40.110 --> 22:41.770
without looking ungrateful.

22:43.000 --> 22:43.790
I hate it.

22:44.400 --> 22:45.030
Yunting,

22:45.550 --> 22:46.470
do you know?

22:46.880 --> 22:48.310
I hate all of it!

22:50.240 --> 22:51.040
Young Master.

22:51.790 --> 22:53.310
Please stop saying such things.

22:53.310 --> 22:54.400
I beg you.

22:54.680 --> 22:56.740
Please keep these words to yourself.

22:56.960 --> 22:58.560
Please don't say it anymore.

22:58.640 --> 22:59.970
Don't say another word.

23:05.830 --> 23:06.510
What?

23:07.160 --> 23:08.720
You're saying Chen Xuanqing

23:08.720 --> 23:10.160
moved into the Hanlin Academy?

23:10.160 --> 23:11.220
He left last night.

23:11.440 --> 23:13.200
They say there's a new assignment
at the Hanlin Academy,

23:13.200 --> 23:14.720
so he returned there to work.

23:14.720 --> 23:15.270
My Lady.

23:15.510 --> 23:17.240
Now you can finally relax a bit.

23:22.240 --> 23:23.270
I just feel that

23:23.680 --> 23:25.540
Third Master noticed something.

23:28.590 --> 23:29.590
You mean

23:30.070 --> 23:31.400
Chen Xuanqing left

23:31.880 --> 23:33.280
because of Third Master?

23:34.000 --> 23:34.920
I'm not sure.

23:36.240 --> 23:37.570
But these past few days,

23:38.110 --> 23:40.110
Third Master has been much quieter.

23:42.350 --> 23:44.200
How about I go ask Chen Yi?

23:46.000 --> 23:46.790
How?

23:49.270 --> 23:50.270
Fair enough.

23:50.790 --> 23:53.390
There's no good way
to ask something like that.

23:54.120 --> 23:55.920
It's all Chen Xuanqing's fault.

23:56.000 --> 23:57.160
Everything was already in the past,

23:57.160 --> 23:59.360
yet he insisted on stirring it up again.

24:01.350 --> 24:01.950
Forget it.

24:02.960 --> 24:04.070
I haven't done anything

24:04.070 --> 24:05.240
shameful anyway.

24:05.640 --> 24:07.040
If it weren't for Wanxue,

24:07.680 --> 24:08.270
there'd be nothing for me

24:08.270 --> 24:09.730
to hide in the first place.

24:10.680 --> 24:11.480
I might as well

24:12.110 --> 24:13.440
just tell him directly.

24:13.550 --> 24:14.950
What are you going to say?

24:21.400 --> 24:23.460
There's something I should tell you.

24:25.350 --> 24:26.400
I used to

24:29.440 --> 24:30.310
have feelings

24:30.640 --> 24:31.700
for Chen Xuanqing.

24:33.270 --> 24:34.270
No. That won't do.

24:36.720 --> 24:37.650
Let me try again.

24:41.550 --> 24:43.160
When I was young and naive,

24:43.880 --> 24:45.030
I had some

24:46.070 --> 24:47.090
feelings for

24:47.440 --> 24:48.300
Chen Xuanqing.

24:49.790 --> 24:51.590
That sounds even worse somehow.

24:53.400 --> 24:54.060
Never mind.

24:54.830 --> 24:56.270
I haven't done anything wrong.

24:56.270 --> 24:57.680
What do I have to be afraid of?

24:57.680 --> 24:58.400
Exactly.

25:02.440 --> 25:03.000
Madam.

25:03.230 --> 25:04.270
Where is Third Master?

25:04.270 --> 25:05.270
Third Master said

25:05.350 --> 25:07.200
he'll be staying at the
Hall of Literary Profundity tonight,

25:07.200 --> 25:09.000
and won't return to the mansion.

25:09.350 --> 25:10.000
I see.

25:14.000 --> 25:14.640
My Lady.

25:15.350 --> 25:18.050
Third Master is avoiding you.

25:18.270 --> 25:19.730
That's not like him at all.

25:20.350 --> 25:21.210
He has never

25:21.350 --> 25:23.210
avoided anyone like this before.

25:25.820 --> 25:27.280
I'll go pack some clothes.

25:27.350 --> 25:28.550
Have Chen Yi take them

25:28.590 --> 25:30.030
to the Hall of Literary Profundity.

25:30.030 --> 25:32.240
Maybe he really is just busy.

25:36.550 --> 25:39.660
[Hall of Literary Profundity]

25:49.830 --> 25:51.560
Jiuheng, you haven't left yet?

25:54.780 --> 25:57.430
[Perfect Harmony]

26:03.160 --> 26:04.350
I have to say,

26:05.960 --> 26:07.510
have you lost weight?

26:07.920 --> 26:09.970
Your complexion doesn't look good either.

26:09.970 --> 26:11.830
Have you been too tired lately?

26:13.830 --> 26:14.550
Yeah.

26:14.650 --> 26:16.850
[Virtue Equal to Heaven and Earth]

26:15.310 --> 26:18.310
The land reform, maritime trade,
and river maintenance,

26:18.310 --> 26:19.710
have all piled up at once.

26:20.240 --> 26:22.160
The memorials never stop coming.

26:21.350 --> 26:24.840
[Virtue Equal to Heaven and Earth]

26:22.400 --> 26:23.920
While the Senior Grand Secretary is away,

26:23.920 --> 26:25.920
you should head home early tonight.

26:26.200 --> 26:27.500
I've been married for years,

26:27.110 --> 26:29.180
[Virtue Equal to Heaven and Earth]

26:27.640 --> 26:29.270
but you're still newlywed.

26:31.330 --> 26:32.160
By the way,

26:32.590 --> 26:34.750
the Reader-in-Waiting
of the Hanlin Academy,

26:34.750 --> 26:36.270
Shao Heng, has left office
for the mourning period.

26:36.270 --> 26:37.880
The post of Imperial Tutor is now vacant.

26:37.880 --> 26:39.070
Do you want

26:39.070 --> 26:41.130
to appoint Xuanqing to the position?

26:43.310 --> 26:45.440
Thank you for your kindness, Zhonglu.

26:45.550 --> 26:46.240
But...

26:47.720 --> 26:48.880
Xuanqing has been in the Hanlin Academy

26:48.880 --> 26:49.920
for less than two years.

26:49.920 --> 26:51.310
He's too inexperienced.

26:51.310 --> 26:52.640
If he gets promoted now,

26:53.400 --> 26:54.720
it'll draw the wrong kind of attention.

26:54.720 --> 26:55.980
Let's forget about it.

26:57.790 --> 27:00.160
You are always so cautious.

27:00.920 --> 27:01.830
Alright, get back to work.

27:01.830 --> 27:06.290
[Perfect Harmony]

27:02.000 --> 27:03.200
I'm heading home now.

27:15.510 --> 27:16.160
Someone.

27:19.790 --> 27:20.720
Prime Minister.

27:21.350 --> 27:22.590
Go fetch some wine for me.

27:22.590 --> 27:23.110
Yes.

27:24.970 --> 27:29.340
[Ji family's Silk Store]

27:30.790 --> 27:31.590
Madam.

27:31.640 --> 27:33.900
Third Master won't be coming back today.

27:37.680 --> 27:38.270
My Lady.

27:38.750 --> 27:40.410
It's already been three days.

27:40.590 --> 27:42.070
I can't keep enduring this.

27:42.070 --> 27:43.600
If this drags on any longer,

27:43.680 --> 27:44.790
even if he can stand it,

27:44.790 --> 27:46.190
I won't be able to take it.

27:56.440 --> 27:57.030
Madam?

28:01.720 --> 28:02.790
Will Master be staying

28:02.790 --> 28:05.590
at the Hall of Literary Profundity
again tonight?

28:06.830 --> 28:07.440
Yes.

28:07.790 --> 28:08.990
What about tomorrow?

28:09.270 --> 28:10.270
Tomorrow as well?

28:13.440 --> 28:15.070
Most likely.

28:16.440 --> 28:17.440
You must be able

28:17.440 --> 28:19.000
to send things into the palace.

28:19.000 --> 28:20.800
Help me send a message to Master.

28:21.070 --> 28:22.470
Tell him I want to see him.

28:23.000 --> 28:24.390
If he refuses to leave the palace,

28:24.390 --> 28:25.240
then tell him

28:25.750 --> 28:27.810
I'll wait for him outside Xihua Gate.

28:28.410 --> 28:29.610
If he's got the nerve,

28:29.880 --> 28:31.340
he better never come back.

28:31.920 --> 28:32.400
Well...

28:35.110 --> 28:35.640
Madam.

28:40.350 --> 28:41.680
Third Master isn't

28:41.830 --> 28:44.160
at the Hall of Literary Profundity today.

28:44.400 --> 28:46.660
He's meeting guests at Baoxiang Temple.

28:47.640 --> 28:48.440
Thank you.

28:52.220 --> 28:53.860
[Baoxiang Temple]

29:01.000 --> 29:03.060
This is a restricted area. Leave now!

29:03.270 --> 29:04.800
I'm here to see Chen Yanyun.

29:05.000 --> 29:05.790
I'm his wife.

29:06.070 --> 29:06.790
His Lordship has ordered

29:06.790 --> 29:08.850
that no one is allowed to disturb him.

29:11.820 --> 29:13.990
[Baoxiang Temple]

29:14.510 --> 29:15.770
Who would have thought

29:15.920 --> 29:17.110
Wang Xuanfan had already been colluding

29:17.110 --> 29:19.240
with Prince Chengqing back when he was

29:19.240 --> 29:22.640
a mere physician at the
Provincial Administration Commission?

29:22.640 --> 29:24.310
No wonder the Capital Garrison

29:24.310 --> 29:26.370
kept losing over the past few months.

29:27.240 --> 29:28.370
By the way, Jiuheng.

29:28.750 --> 29:30.240
I did exactly as you instructed.

29:30.240 --> 29:32.160
I had Zhang Hengyi
from the Ministry of Rites

29:32.160 --> 29:34.020
submit an impeachment memorial.

29:34.030 --> 29:35.230
If things go quickly,

29:35.510 --> 29:37.510
His Majesty and the Senior Grand Secretary

29:37.510 --> 29:38.770
should see it tonight.

29:40.310 --> 29:41.960
I appreciate the help, Yao.

29:43.160 --> 29:44.220
No need to thank me.

29:45.070 --> 29:47.400
Wang Xuanfan and I were friends for years,

29:48.200 --> 29:50.130
but the moment you married Miss Gu,

29:50.590 --> 29:52.240
he started putting up walls against us.

29:52.240 --> 29:52.920
However,

29:53.160 --> 29:55.290
Wang Xuanfan wasn't wrong about that.

29:55.510 --> 29:57.110
Since we are now in-laws,

29:57.690 --> 29:59.170
we should be much closer.

30:01.440 --> 30:02.440
Cheers, Yao.

30:02.510 --> 30:03.000
Okay.

30:07.180 --> 30:10.580
[Baoxiang Temple]

30:37.110 --> 30:38.440
It really is much colder

30:38.440 --> 30:40.300
in the mountains than in the city.

30:41.440 --> 30:43.040
Earlier, I was even thinking

30:43.240 --> 30:45.160
about asking my fourth daughter-in-law

30:45.160 --> 30:46.000
and her mother

30:46.350 --> 30:48.200
to visit your mansion,

30:48.680 --> 30:50.680
just to use it as a convenient cover.

30:51.240 --> 30:52.840
After all, our interactions

30:53.270 --> 30:55.530
have always made certain people uneasy.

30:55.720 --> 30:56.920
But I didn't expect

30:57.350 --> 30:59.000
you haven't even been staying

30:59.000 --> 31:00.530
at your own mansion lately.

31:02.510 --> 31:03.840
There are so many things

31:03.880 --> 31:05.280
to handle, big and small,

31:05.640 --> 31:06.570
so I chose to stay

31:06.680 --> 31:08.070
at the Hall of Literary Profundity.

31:08.070 --> 31:09.200
I understand.

31:09.270 --> 31:10.330
Going home too late

31:10.880 --> 31:12.280
might get you a scolding.

31:13.960 --> 31:15.880
Now that we are exposing Wang Xuanfan's

31:15.880 --> 31:17.960
collusion with the late Prince Chengqing,

31:17.960 --> 31:19.790
he will surely drag Gu Deyuan

31:20.200 --> 31:21.670
down with him

31:21.830 --> 31:23.110
to protect himself,

31:24.000 --> 31:26.080
hoping to implicate you as well.

31:26.440 --> 31:27.770
Forgive me for nagging,

31:29.400 --> 31:30.720
but let me ask you one more time:

31:30.720 --> 31:32.050
Are we truly not going to

31:32.590 --> 31:33.640
save Gu Deyuan?

31:34.200 --> 31:35.160
Gu Deyuan

31:35.440 --> 31:36.760
is an imperial censor,

31:37.030 --> 31:38.350
yet he is utterly corrupt

31:38.350 --> 31:39.680
and insatiably greedy.

31:40.440 --> 31:42.510
Even if Wang Xuanfan
weren't investigating him,

31:42.510 --> 31:44.310
I would still punish him myself.

31:46.510 --> 31:47.040
Alright.

31:47.920 --> 31:49.380
I will follow your lead and

31:49.510 --> 31:51.970
place righteousness above family for once.

31:55.680 --> 31:57.680
Third Master,
a messenger from the palace has arrived,

31:57.680 --> 31:59.680
saying His Majesty
has summoned you urgently.

31:59.680 --> 32:01.550
His Majesty must have seen the memorial.

32:01.550 --> 32:03.480
Jiuheng, go to the palace quickly.

32:16.960 --> 32:17.550
My Lady.

32:20.480 --> 32:21.070
My Lady.

32:25.030 --> 32:25.720
My Lady.

32:27.070 --> 32:28.530
The guards over there said

32:29.680 --> 32:32.340
that Third Master
has headed down the mountain.

32:36.350 --> 32:37.920
Is he that afraid to see me?

32:39.310 --> 32:39.960
Forget it.

32:41.830 --> 32:43.030
Let's go back too.

32:46.440 --> 32:46.960
My Lady.

32:51.750 --> 32:52.270
I,

32:52.510 --> 32:54.680
Zhang Hengyi,
Supervising Secretary of the Rites,

32:54.680 --> 32:55.950
have a memorial to present.

32:55.950 --> 32:58.110
In October of the 25th year of Jingning,

32:58.110 --> 33:00.310
Prince Chengqing plotted a rebellion.

33:00.400 --> 33:01.510
In the first three months,

33:01.510 --> 33:03.640
our forces suffered constant defeats,

33:03.640 --> 33:05.440
leading many to suspect that

33:05.790 --> 33:07.990
a mole in the court was leaking secrets.

33:08.200 --> 33:09.200
And Wang Xuanfan,

33:09.240 --> 33:11.240
who was a physician at
the Provincial Administration Commission,

33:11.240 --> 33:13.500
was on good terms with Prince Chengqing.

33:14.270 --> 33:15.310
Nonsense!

33:17.960 --> 33:18.760
Your Majesty,

33:19.030 --> 33:19.720
at that time, I had

33:19.720 --> 33:21.640
no dealings with Prince Chengqing.

33:21.640 --> 33:22.770
This Zhang Hengyi is

33:22.790 --> 33:24.590
fabricating allegations out of thin air!

33:24.590 --> 33:26.190
He harbors malicious intent

33:26.440 --> 33:28.040
and deserves to be executed!

33:28.440 --> 33:31.170
Lord Zhang is not making things up
out of thin air.

33:32.070 --> 33:32.870
Chen Jiuheng.

33:36.310 --> 33:37.220
Your Majesty,

33:37.510 --> 33:39.210
I know something

33:39.350 --> 33:40.350
that can prove that

33:40.350 --> 33:42.070
the late Prince Chengqing and Lord Wang

33:42.070 --> 33:43.590
not only had a lot of dealings,

33:43.590 --> 33:44.320
but were also

33:44.960 --> 33:46.590
extremely close.

33:46.920 --> 33:47.960
Is Jiuheng

33:48.070 --> 33:49.510
going against Lord Chengyuan

33:49.510 --> 33:50.510
in public?

33:51.160 --> 33:52.640
They've held a grudge for years,

33:52.640 --> 33:54.570
and it could explode at any moment.

33:54.680 --> 33:57.110
Let's see what the Senior Grand Secretary
intends to do.

33:57.110 --> 33:59.640
On the 8th day of October
in the 25th year of Jingning,

33:59.640 --> 34:01.000
Vice Minister of War, Zhu Guoming,

34:01.000 --> 34:02.730
celebrated his 60th birthday.

34:02.960 --> 34:04.880
The late Prince Chengqing and Lord Wang

34:04.880 --> 34:06.070
both attended the banquet.

34:06.070 --> 34:09.110
The late Prince Chengqing
brought two beautiful maids

34:09.110 --> 34:10.510
and gifted them respectively to

34:10.510 --> 34:12.920
Zhu Guoming and Lord Wang.

34:13.190 --> 34:13.989
Chen Jiuheng,

34:14.230 --> 34:15.630
do you have any evidence?

34:15.840 --> 34:18.040
In October of the 26th year of Jingning,

34:18.400 --> 34:19.590
news reached the capital

34:19.590 --> 34:20.550
that the late Prince Chengqing's rebellion

34:20.550 --> 34:21.840
had failed, and he was

34:21.960 --> 34:23.360
slain by Marquis Changxing.

34:23.360 --> 34:24.960
Soon after, Zhu Guoming allegedly

34:24.960 --> 34:26.620
died of a sudden heart attack.

34:27.960 --> 34:29.440
But what no one knew was

34:29.920 --> 34:31.520
that in Lord Wang's mansion,

34:31.840 --> 34:33.630
a maid also died a sudden death.

34:34.760 --> 34:36.230
Zhu Guoming was proven to be

34:36.230 --> 34:38.400
a traitor colluding with Prince Chengqing.

34:38.400 --> 34:40.199
His entire family was executed.

34:40.590 --> 34:43.190
Yet Lord Wang has lived in peace,

34:43.400 --> 34:44.400
and has even

34:45.320 --> 34:46.760
been promoted repeatedly.

34:46.760 --> 34:47.710
Nonsense!

34:48.320 --> 34:49.120
Your Majesty,

34:49.550 --> 34:50.440
Chen Yanyun is framing me

34:50.440 --> 34:52.040
with baseless accusations,

34:52.320 --> 34:53.360
because he knows

34:53.440 --> 34:53.920
I'm investigating

34:53.920 --> 34:55.630
the case of Censor-in-Chief Gu Deyuan.

34:55.630 --> 34:57.070
As an imperial censor, Gu Deyuan

34:57.070 --> 34:58.590
covered up crimes for corrupt officials.

34:58.590 --> 35:00.000
His niece is married to Chen Yanyun,

35:00.000 --> 35:01.800
so he became Chen Yanyun's pawn.

35:01.800 --> 35:03.320
He accepted bribes many times

35:03.320 --> 35:04.630
and sold official posts.

35:04.630 --> 35:06.000
I request a joint trial
by the Three Judiciary Offices

35:06.000 --> 35:08.260
to thoroughly investigate Chen Yanyun.

35:08.410 --> 35:10.850
But you two are both Grand Secretaries.

35:09.410 --> 35:13.260
[The Emperor Establishes Supreme Order]

35:12.070 --> 35:13.670
Mr. Fu, what is your opinion?

35:14.670 --> 35:15.550
Your Majesty,

35:16.920 --> 35:18.590
the nation has its laws.

35:18.960 --> 35:20.550
Even though the two of them
are Grand Secretaries,

35:20.550 --> 35:21.880
it makes no difference.

35:22.110 --> 35:23.910
Since they have been impeached,

35:24.110 --> 35:25.170
they should resign

35:25.280 --> 35:27.000
and await punishment

35:27.360 --> 35:28.800
until the Three Judiciary Offices

35:28.800 --> 35:30.530
conduct a full investigation.

35:31.920 --> 35:33.630
We shall do as Mr. Fu advises.

35:32.260 --> 35:34.370
[The Emperor Establishes Supreme Order]

36:09.910 --> 36:10.540
Mother.

36:11.020 --> 36:13.220
It's my fault for not raising you right.

36:13.670 --> 36:14.670
Corruption and bribery

36:14.670 --> 36:16.600
are things you should never touch.

36:18.810 --> 36:20.420
I was wrong.

36:20.710 --> 36:23.880
I was so wrong.

36:31.030 --> 36:32.930
Please take care of yourself

36:33.480 --> 36:35.230
while I'm gone.

36:38.710 --> 36:39.670
Leave.

36:41.150 --> 36:42.190
I will take care

36:43.070 --> 36:44.920
of everything at the mansion.

36:45.110 --> 36:45.910
Take him away.

36:52.960 --> 36:54.110
Master.

36:54.230 --> 36:54.960
Don't cry.

36:57.550 --> 36:58.410
Save your tears

36:59.030 --> 37:00.760
when we get to the Chen Mansion.

37:01.280 --> 37:02.550
Right now,

37:03.760 --> 37:05.030
only Zhao

37:06.110 --> 37:07.190
can save Deyuan.

37:10.800 --> 37:11.600
Third Master.

37:12.360 --> 37:13.160
Let's go home.

37:13.510 --> 37:15.230
Gu Deyuan was taken
by the Court of Judicial Review.

37:15.230 --> 37:15.960
The Gu family

37:16.030 --> 37:17.670
will definitely pester Jinzhao.

37:17.670 --> 37:20.070
Yes. There's one more thing, Third Master.

37:20.190 --> 37:21.150
Madam went to

37:21.510 --> 37:23.110
Baoxiang Temple yesterday.

37:23.510 --> 37:24.670
I only found out about it

37:24.670 --> 37:25.510
this morning.

37:26.360 --> 37:27.400
You were at court

37:27.510 --> 37:28.910
so I couldn't inform you.

37:29.710 --> 37:31.020
I understand. Let's go.

37:31.020 --> 37:33.860
[Ancestral Virtues, Our Guiding Light]

37:32.710 --> 37:34.590
This happened many years ago.

37:35.320 --> 37:37.590
Now they're suddenly bringing it up again.

37:37.590 --> 37:39.800
They said they'd investigate thoroughly

37:39.800 --> 37:40.800
and locked your second uncle up

37:40.800 --> 37:42.190
in the Court of Judicial Review.

37:42.190 --> 37:43.990
They won't even let us visit him.

37:44.560 --> 37:45.500
Zhao,

37:45.840 --> 37:47.360
talk to your husband

37:47.550 --> 37:49.610
and ask him to save your second uncle.

37:50.900 --> 37:52.610
I'm afraid that won't be easy.

37:52.710 --> 37:54.400
What are you talking about?

37:55.190 --> 37:56.670
Your husband is the Grand Secretary.

37:56.670 --> 37:57.670
Saving someone's life

37:57.670 --> 37:59.670
is just a matter of a word from him.

38:00.400 --> 38:01.450
Zhao,

38:01.510 --> 38:03.070
we are family.

38:03.190 --> 38:03.840
If something happens

38:03.840 --> 38:05.630
to your second uncle,

38:06.030 --> 38:06.840
it won't look good

38:06.840 --> 38:08.510
for you and your husband.

38:09.110 --> 38:10.970
It's not that I don't want to help,

38:11.110 --> 38:12.640
but the crime

38:12.760 --> 38:13.920
Second Uncle committed

38:13.920 --> 38:14.960
is just far too serious.

38:14.960 --> 38:16.670
And the evidence is concrete.

38:18.000 --> 38:20.110
How is the evidence concrete?

38:20.230 --> 38:22.150
You are a member of the Gu family.

38:22.360 --> 38:24.940
How can you say that?

38:25.710 --> 38:26.510
Second Madam.

38:27.000 --> 38:27.670
My Lady

38:27.670 --> 38:29.000
caught a cold last night

38:29.070 --> 38:30.760
and isn't feeling well right now.

38:30.760 --> 38:31.500
How about

38:32.150 --> 38:33.510
you come back another day?

38:33.510 --> 38:34.510
Zhao!

38:35.400 --> 38:36.670
Zhao!

38:36.800 --> 38:38.840
For the sake of my pregnancy,

38:38.840 --> 38:40.630
please save my father.

38:40.630 --> 38:42.320
I beg you, Zhao.

38:42.320 --> 38:42.760
Miss Lan,

38:42.760 --> 38:44.030
please stop pulling at my lady.

38:44.030 --> 38:44.960
Zhao,

38:45.360 --> 38:46.280
I really

38:46.280 --> 38:47.800
have no other way.

38:48.590 --> 38:49.970
The entire Yao family

38:50.030 --> 38:52.000
is heartless.

38:52.110 --> 38:54.590
After seeing what happened to my father,

38:54.590 --> 38:57.290
they can't wait to cut ties with me.

38:57.400 --> 38:58.920
Zhao.

38:59.280 --> 39:00.480
Now I finally realize

39:00.480 --> 39:02.030
that we are family.

39:02.190 --> 39:03.630
I was wrong before.

39:03.630 --> 39:04.760
Zhao.

39:07.630 --> 39:08.550
Lian!

39:09.400 --> 39:10.710
-Lian.
-Lian.

39:10.840 --> 39:12.400
-Lian.
-Lian.

39:12.420 --> 39:14.710
-Lian.
-Lian.

39:14.710 --> 39:15.770
Fetch a physician!

39:15.800 --> 39:16.510
-Lian.
-No.

39:16.510 --> 39:17.510
Fetch a female physician instead.

39:17.510 --> 39:18.400
Don't let anyone know.

39:18.400 --> 39:19.000
Lian.

39:19.000 --> 39:19.510
Yes.

39:21.280 --> 39:22.760
Didn't we agree

39:23.150 --> 39:25.400
to prepare for the wedding at home?

39:26.030 --> 39:28.430
Why did you suddenly
move into the academy?

39:29.280 --> 39:30.410
Since you moved out,

39:30.960 --> 39:32.670
you haven't come back
to pay your respects.

39:32.670 --> 39:33.880
That is one thing.

39:34.800 --> 39:35.710
And I heard

39:36.230 --> 39:39.670
that even when you need clothes or books,

39:40.110 --> 39:42.110
you only send your servants

39:42.360 --> 39:44.820
to sneak in,
collect your things, and leave.

39:45.440 --> 39:46.840
Those who know the situation

39:46.840 --> 39:48.570
will say you're busy with work.

39:49.000 --> 39:50.110
Those who don't

39:50.710 --> 39:52.910
might think the family mistreated you.

39:55.840 --> 39:57.030
I know

39:57.510 --> 39:59.500
you have a lot on your mind,

40:00.230 --> 40:01.840
but I don't care

40:01.840 --> 40:03.570
what exactly you're thinking.

40:04.630 --> 40:06.440
Since your surname is Chen,

40:07.510 --> 40:08.710
in everything you do,

40:09.000 --> 40:11.000
you can't just

40:11.000 --> 40:12.320
think about yourself.

40:12.710 --> 40:16.280
You must also consider this family.

40:16.760 --> 40:17.560
Grandmother,

40:17.630 --> 40:18.630
you misunderstood.

40:18.630 --> 40:19.630
-Old Madam.
-I...

40:19.880 --> 40:20.550
Old Madam,

40:23.320 --> 40:24.710
the Gu family is making a scene

40:24.710 --> 40:26.190
at Third Madam's courtyard.

40:26.190 --> 40:27.120
For some reason,

40:27.510 --> 40:29.710
they even summoned a female physician.

40:30.030 --> 40:32.360
Don't tell me something went wrong there?

40:33.070 --> 40:34.930
Grandmother, I'll go take a look.

40:46.230 --> 40:47.320
It's karma.

40:47.670 --> 40:49.600
It's all my karma catching up to me.

40:53.480 --> 40:54.940
It's good that she is fine.

40:55.590 --> 40:57.390
Let her get some proper rest now.

41:00.360 --> 41:01.400
Ms. Zhao,

41:01.920 --> 41:04.000
please take good care of her.

41:05.190 --> 41:06.360
I don't feel well.

41:06.840 --> 41:08.000
I'm going out for some fresh air.

41:08.000 --> 41:08.730
Yes, My Lady.

41:09.000 --> 41:10.660
Please take care of yourself.

41:32.320 --> 41:33.580
Why are you here?

41:34.070 --> 41:35.000
Aren't you sick?

41:35.190 --> 41:36.650
Why are you still outside?

41:42.070 --> 41:43.280
Let go of me!

41:43.710 --> 41:44.400
-You're already in this state,
-Let go of me!

41:44.400 --> 41:45.320
yet you still care about such things?

41:45.320 --> 41:46.150
Let go of me!

41:46.150 --> 41:46.800
Why must you

41:46.800 --> 41:47.400
keep pushing me away?

41:47.400 --> 41:47.880
Let go of me!

41:47.880 --> 41:48.440
Have you forgotten

41:48.440 --> 41:49.070
everything you ever said to me?

41:49.070 --> 41:50.000
Let go of me!

41:54.320 --> 41:55.190
Third Master.

41:56.840 --> 41:57.840
Third Uncle.

41:58.030 --> 41:58.510
I...

42:05.840 --> 42:06.570
Third Uncle.

42:09.150 --> 42:10.190
You can't do this.

42:11.190 --> 42:11.710
My grandmother

42:11.710 --> 42:13.510
and second aunt are both inside.

42:14.280 --> 42:15.070
Let go.

42:16.510 --> 42:17.400
Let go!

42:22.150 --> 42:22.710
Get lost!

42:28.550 --> 42:30.080
About what happened today,

42:30.920 --> 42:33.060
don't breathe a word of it to anyone!

42:33.080 --> 42:34.540
Don't let me see you again!

42:38.590 --> 42:39.590
Why?

42:42.400 --> 42:43.440
Why should you?

42:45.630 --> 42:46.440
Do you think

42:46.440 --> 42:47.950
just because you are the Grand Secretary,

42:47.950 --> 42:49.280
you can decide life and death

42:49.280 --> 42:50.680
and do whatever you want?

42:53.000 --> 42:54.050
Do you know

42:54.510 --> 42:56.370
that I was the one she liked first?

43:00.590 --> 43:01.660
It was you

43:02.590 --> 43:03.710
who meddled in

43:04.630 --> 43:06.150
and took her away from me.

43:06.360 --> 43:07.000
If it weren't for you,

43:07.000 --> 43:09.000
we would've been together long ago!

43:20.000 --> 43:23.930
[A Splendid Match]
